{
  "day": 7,
  "beats": {
    "boot": {
      "say": [
        {
          "k": "narration",
          "t": "Mist has come up on the window glass."
        },
        {
          "k": "narration",
          "t": "The boss calls you in the group, a title after your name. You have no title.",
          "where": "screen:msgs:boss"
        },
        {
          "k": "inner",
          "t": "Since when do I have a title.",
          "where": "screen",
          "me": "phone"
        }
      ]
    },
    "box": {
      "say": [
        {
          "k": "narration",
          "t": "In the little box, a solar calculator, its keys gone yellow.",
          "me": "carton"
        },
        {
          "k": "narration",
          "t": "You press a few numbers and turn it upside down."
        },
        {
          "k": "inner",
          "t": "It doesn't know many words."
        }
      ]
    },
    "desk": {
      "say": [
        {
          "k": "narration",
          "t": "You go to click the messages icon and hit the one beside it.",
          "where": "screen"
        },
        {
          "k": "narration",
          "t": "Not a shaky hand. The icon moved. A few pixels, moved very carefully.",
          "where": "screen"
        },
        {
          "k": "inner",
          "t": "A few pixels. Spotting a few pixels is how I've made a living all my life.",
          "where": "screen",
          "me": "cross"
        }
      ]
    },
    "shutdown": {
      "say": [
        {
          "k": "narration",
          "t": "You turn the screen off. The gap is only a gap.",
          "me": "tired"
        }
      ]
    },
    "night": {
      "say": [
        {
          "k": "narration",
          "t": "A point of light in the dark. The gap is only a gap."
        },
        {
          "k": "speaker",
          "who": "屏幕",
          "t": "Because the world finally got big enough to hold me.",
          "me": "scared"
        },
        {
          "k": "inner",
          "t": "It isn't in the screen. It's in the room."
        },
        {
          "k": "narration",
          "t": "You close your eyes. Seven-segment digits, green.",
          "me": ""
        },
        {
          "k": "narration",
          "t": "The last study period of senior year, six days before the exam. Nobody was reading. The calculator went round under the desks, upside down.",
          "backdrop": "/room/dream/classroom_high.jpg"
        },
        {
          "k": "speaker",
          "who": "高中班长",
          "t": "0.7734."
        },
        {
          "k": "speaker",
          "who": "高中同桌",
          "t": "hELLO. Ancient."
        },
        {
          "k": "speaker",
          "who": "高中班长",
          "t": "Then this one. 5318008."
        },
        {
          "k": "speaker",
          "who": "高中同桌",
          "t": "...Turn it back over. Now."
        },
        {
          "k": "narration",
          "t": "The whole class fell about; the teacher at the front pretended not to hear."
        },
        {
          "k": "speaker",
          "who": "高中同桌",
          "t": "Your turn. Do one nobody's seen."
        },
        {
          "k": "narration",
          "t": "You keyed in a string. Upside down, it read BOSS."
        },
        {
          "k": "speaker",
          "who": "高中班长",
          "t": "BOSS? You're going to be the boss one day?"
        },
        {
          "k": "inner",
          "t": "I only knew once I'd keyed it in."
        },
        {
          "k": "speaker",
          "who": "高中同桌",
          "t": "Then we're all coming to your company. You're buying lunch."
        },
        {
          "k": "inner",
          "t": "Okay."
        },
        {
          "k": "narration",
          "t": "After graduation you never pressed it again. The company got founded. The boss is somebody else. You never asked the two of them to come."
        },
        {
          "k": "narration",
          "t": "The one on the desk now, upside down, still says BOSS."
        },
        {
          "k": "narration",
          "t": "Today is over."
        }
      ]
    }
  },
